WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 35]

01:39.790 --> 01:41.460
There's a 50% chance

01:41.870 --> 01:43.740
you'll be able to take Yong's life.

01:45.350 --> 01:46.660
I do want to try.

01:49.710 --> 01:50.850
But you'll die too.

01:52.870 --> 01:54.690
I think that price

01:55.870 --> 01:56.850
is not worth it.

01:59.680 --> 02:00.330
Yeah.

02:01.710 --> 02:03.020
Staying alive matters more.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.260
I'm really angry right now, though.

02:12.360 --> 02:13.500
Your miracle physician

02:14.280 --> 02:15.220
wrecked our plan.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.130
Plan?

02:17.750 --> 02:18.820
You never told me

02:18.840 --> 02:20.130
any plan of yours.

02:21.080 --> 02:22.010
Before I went into seclusion,

02:22.030 --> 02:23.100
I told them

02:23.240 --> 02:24.010
not to act rashly.

02:24.310 --> 02:25.540
Just keep the clinic open.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.610
So why did keeping the clinic open

02:29.520 --> 02:31.100
bring deadly trouble?

02:33.310 --> 02:34.130
Sir,

02:35.280 --> 02:36.260
It's all

02:36.520 --> 02:37.570
just a misunderstanding.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.810
Just some

02:39.840 --> 02:40.980
sudden turns.

02:43.240 --> 02:44.100
But now,

02:45.120 --> 02:46.820
we're curious

02:47.870 --> 02:48.730
whether...

02:52.910 --> 02:56.060
you and Master Su

02:56.630 --> 02:58.890
picked different allies.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.290
Su Muyu doesn't know my choice.

03:11.120 --> 03:13.170
He's still all in on the Prince of Langya.

03:14.400 --> 03:16.010
I don't agree.

03:17.470 --> 03:19.010
The Prince of Langya can give him

03:19.040 --> 03:19.780
the help he wants

03:19.840 --> 03:20.890
but not me.

03:22.590 --> 03:24.540
Because I want to be No.1 in the jianghu.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.940
From the first time I met you,

03:29.910 --> 03:30.780
I knew,

03:31.470 --> 03:32.340
Sir,

03:33.560 --> 03:35.100
you were ambitious.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.290
This is a truth-testing snake,

03:51.800 --> 03:52.820
a gift sent to me

03:52.870 --> 03:54.100
from Nanjue.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.450
It carries a rare poison

03:57.430 --> 03:58.690
that kills on contact.

03:59.960 --> 04:01.010
Yet it's gentle by nature.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.220
When you touch it

04:03.280 --> 04:04.100
in ordinary times,

04:04.590 --> 04:06.060
it won't react at all.

04:07.560 --> 04:08.610
But if you touch it

04:08.680 --> 04:09.730
while telling a lie,

04:10.840 --> 04:12.980
it can sense

04:13.750 --> 04:15.130
even the slightest change.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.850
And it will snap at you.

04:18.720 --> 04:19.540
Sir,

04:20.510 --> 04:21.540
care to try?

04:24.830 --> 04:26.170
Interesting.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.140
Why did you and Master Su

04:28.190 --> 04:29.100
choose differently?

04:30.240 --> 04:31.930
Why not side with the Prince of Langya?

04:37.630 --> 04:39.020
Just like you,

04:40.160 --> 04:41.250
once you're high up,

04:41.310 --> 04:42.930
the next step is reaching the peak.

04:44.270 --> 04:45.780
Even with the Prince of Langya helping us,

04:46.310 --> 04:47.930
Xueyue City stays No.1.

04:49.190 --> 04:49.980
But if you

04:50.680 --> 04:51.610
topple the Prince of Langya,

04:51.630 --> 04:52.720
then Blood River

04:54.310 --> 04:55.980
will become emperor of the jianghu.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.340
Bold talk.

05:04.680 --> 05:05.810
"Emperor of the jianghu"?

05:07.360 --> 05:09.020
That's quite the arrogance.

05:11.560 --> 05:12.810
If Su Muyu

05:13.680 --> 05:15.020
blocks our plan,

05:16.630 --> 05:17.490
would you kill him?

05:19.270 --> 05:20.340
Kill Su Muyu?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.780
Don't ask something so out of line.

05:44.310 --> 05:45.410
That's costly.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.140
It doesn't matter

05:50.950 --> 05:51.780
who you will kill

05:52.480 --> 05:53.540
or won't kill.

05:54.510 --> 05:56.020
We share an enemy,

05:57.360 --> 05:58.660
and that's enough.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.100
Next,

06:04.240 --> 06:05.540
I'll tell you

06:07.360 --> 06:08.730
our plan.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.250
I hope your plan

06:11.270 --> 06:12.320
won't let me down.

06:13.270 --> 06:14.370
My patience is limited.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.140
Then we start

06:17.870 --> 06:20.900
from His Majesty's accession.

06:23.740 --> 06:27.780
[Qiushui Cottage]

06:34.360 --> 06:35.380
Good wine.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.850
It goes straight to the head.

06:38.190 --> 06:39.410
Tonight,

06:40.510 --> 06:41.540
you've drunk plenty.

06:42.630 --> 06:44.290
Because I won't get drunk tonight.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.220
Shameless as it sounds,

06:47.240 --> 06:48.580
a by-any-means plan

06:48.870 --> 06:50.460
to reach the goal.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.590
But it suits me,

06:53.110 --> 06:53.750
perfectly.

06:57.870 --> 06:58.660
Then, Sir...

07:02.680 --> 07:04.170
Tianqi City will be yours.

07:25.040 --> 07:25.700
Changhe,

07:27.430 --> 07:28.610
since you left seclusion,

07:29.390 --> 07:30.730
you seem different.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.290
Nonsense.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.900
I've barely been out.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.730
It's not about time.

07:37.480 --> 07:39.360
You just look

07:39.720 --> 07:40.730
harder to read.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.410
Is it because of the Hell Palm?

07:44.430 --> 07:45.490
That old man Mu said...

07:45.560 --> 07:46.250
No need to worry.

07:46.680 --> 07:47.370
I know what I'm doing.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.540
When have I ever lied to you?

07:52.720 --> 07:53.340
You have.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.170
You said you'd found a great place,

07:57.200 --> 07:58.190
no worries about food or drink.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.320
And then,

07:59.480 --> 08:00.490
you dragged me into Blood River.

08:03.510 --> 08:05.170
Blame it on Su Muyu.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.580
But look at you,

08:07.070 --> 08:07.930
you're grown,

08:07.950 --> 08:09.100
yet still like a kid,

08:09.560 --> 08:10.490
rambling,

08:10.560 --> 08:11.490
and worrying.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.220
When will you stand on your own?

08:15.190 --> 08:15.810
No matter.

08:16.390 --> 08:17.460
As long as I'm here,

08:18.000 --> 08:19.580
you can stay behind me.

08:23.240 --> 08:23.810
So,

08:24.390 --> 08:25.900
do we go find Muyu and the others?

08:27.720 --> 08:28.340
No.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.700
And don't tell them I'm out.

08:34.030 --> 08:34.980
Tonight,

08:35.480 --> 08:37.300
I'll take a good walk around Tianqi City.

08:37.960 --> 08:38.490
Changhe,

08:39.150 --> 08:40.700
we really don't tell Muyu?

08:42.600 --> 08:43.490
He won't agree.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.530
I have my plan.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.580
Have you found where they are?

09:03.840 --> 09:06.220
They pride themselves on hiding.

09:07.510 --> 09:09.530
[The third courtyard on the east side]
But my branch in Tianqi City

09:09.850 --> 09:11.160
[of Sweetwater Lane in the south]
also Mu by name.

09:12.510 --> 09:14.300
And we're good at tracking.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.250
Your Highness,

09:18.720 --> 09:19.820
we've located Su Muyu

09:20.390 --> 09:21.700
and their hideout.

09:25.320 --> 09:25.820
Your Highness,

09:26.150 --> 09:27.220
a report from General Dian Ye:

09:27.480 --> 09:28.530
His Majesty has granted him authority

09:28.960 --> 09:30.340
to sweep the city for the General's Residence assassins

09:30.550 --> 09:31.980
and execute them on the spot.

09:40.440 --> 09:41.650
Interesting.

09:42.150 --> 09:42.990
But we just met

09:42.990 --> 09:44.020
with Su Changhe

09:44.020 --> 09:45.210
and strike them next,

09:45.210 --> 09:45.980
isn't that a bit...

09:46.150 --> 09:47.370
What Su Muyu does

09:48.150 --> 09:49.580
isn't Su Changhe's to control.

09:50.960 --> 09:52.770
Likewise, how can I control

09:54.480 --> 09:55.940
what the Flying Tiger General

09:56.870 --> 09:57.850
wants?

10:02.320 --> 10:04.370
Give that hideout location

10:05.750 --> 10:06.580
to my uncle,

10:08.720 --> 10:09.420
and let him

10:10.720 --> 10:11.850
do as he sees fit.

10:13.320 --> 10:13.940
Understood.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.420
Greetings, Your Highness.

10:30.870 --> 10:31.420
Your Highness,

10:32.030 --> 10:32.890
His Majesty requests your presence.

10:38.480 --> 10:39.340
Su Muyu...

10:46.870 --> 10:48.060
Reborn from the ashes,

10:48.720 --> 10:50.100
you'll be more powerful!

10:55.480 --> 10:56.130
Father!

11:08.600 --> 11:09.250
Don't worry.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.100
He's fine.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.300
Father, you're acting tough here.

11:18.270 --> 11:18.890
Miracle physician,

11:19.390 --> 11:20.250
how is Uncle Zhe?

11:22.150 --> 11:22.770
No big problem.

11:27.150 --> 11:27.940
Good.

11:28.670 --> 11:29.460
Many are coming.

11:29.630 --> 11:30.340
Besides the Jinwu Guard,

11:30.600 --> 11:32.250
other masters are heading this way.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.250
You may take Su Muyu,

11:37.600 --> 11:38.060
Uncle Zhe,

11:38.200 --> 11:39.010
and the miracle physician first.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.370
I'll stay and hold them off.

11:40.870 --> 11:41.770
You alone

11:42.000 --> 11:42.700
are too dangerous!

11:43.240 --> 11:43.770
Right now,

11:44.510 --> 11:45.300
the Patriarch is away,

11:45.720 --> 11:46.700
and Master Su has fainted.

11:47.360 --> 11:48.610
So, I call the shots in Blood River.

11:48.910 --> 11:49.770
You should all listen to me.

11:50.120 --> 11:50.650
Move now.

11:51.790 --> 11:52.220
You guys,

11:52.600 --> 11:54.010
help Su Muyu and Uncle Zhe up first.

11:54.510 --> 11:55.060
Master Mu,

11:55.510 --> 11:56.370
why not come with us?

11:57.200 --> 11:57.890
If we all go,

11:58.630 --> 11:59.700
they'll catch us fast.

12:00.120 --> 12:00.730
I'll stay here

12:00.750 --> 12:01.940
and stall them with a mist formation.

12:02.390 --> 12:03.180
They'll think

12:03.600 --> 12:04.940
we're all still in this place.

12:08.870 --> 12:09.460
Rest easy.

12:09.870 --> 12:10.850
I have ways to keep myself safe.

12:14.150 --> 12:14.730
But...

12:16.870 --> 12:17.530
Go now!

12:20.600 --> 12:21.340
If you stay,

12:21.510 --> 12:22.370
everyone will die!

12:43.080 --> 12:43.850
Why aren't you leaving?

12:44.750 --> 12:45.580
Because you said

12:46.790 --> 12:48.130
your formation with my poisons

12:49.320 --> 12:50.370
is peerless.

12:52.270 --> 12:52.730
Wrong.

12:54.910 --> 12:55.700
Me matching you

12:57.030 --> 12:57.940
is peerless.

13:25.580 --> 13:28.980
[He-Yu Clinic]

13:33.270 --> 13:33.820
Master,

13:34.240 --> 13:35.700
why are we back at the Clinic?

13:36.320 --> 13:37.130
The most dangerous place

13:37.390 --> 13:38.460
is the safest.

13:38.870 --> 13:40.340
We'll rest here for now.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.700
No idea how Mu Qingyang

13:44.870 --> 13:45.580
is doing.

13:46.150 --> 13:46.730
Don't worry.

13:47.000 --> 13:48.370
He has many lifesaving tricks.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.370
He should be fine.

13:50.080 --> 13:51.420
Once no one's on your tail

13:51.630 --> 13:52.580
and there's no threat left,

13:52.790 --> 13:53.460
Yin the Tiger and I

13:53.630 --> 13:54.820
will scout Ms. Wan'er's place.

13:55.630 --> 13:57.060
Then we'll guard Su Muyu.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.130
When he wakes,

13:58.390 --> 13:59.130
we'll plan our next move.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.130
Your game

14:06.790 --> 14:07.730
has improved.

14:09.000 --> 14:09.730
The last time

14:10.390 --> 14:11.850
I played a match with you

14:13.440 --> 14:15.130
was before Mother passed.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.890
So many years have gone by.

14:18.720 --> 14:19.460
Progress

14:20.120 --> 14:20.940
is only right.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.130
After all,

14:24.000 --> 14:26.340
no one stands still.

14:27.630 --> 14:28.370
People

14:29.240 --> 14:30.010
and the game

14:31.150 --> 14:32.250
must move forward.

14:34.960 --> 14:35.730
True.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.490
You now talk

14:39.240 --> 14:40.610
much more than before.

14:41.360 --> 14:42.300
Your moves on the board

14:43.080 --> 14:44.580
are far bolder as well.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.340
But on a wrong board,

14:55.440 --> 14:56.610
if you keep playing,

14:58.240 --> 14:59.980
you'll lose it all.

15:05.200 --> 15:05.890
Well,

15:08.720 --> 15:09.700
I'm not afraid to lose.

15:12.480 --> 15:14.250
I fear having no chance to play.

15:16.120 --> 15:16.890
You usually play

15:17.720 --> 15:18.820
with my younger brothers.

15:20.960 --> 15:22.370
But today's game

15:23.720 --> 15:25.100
is the result of years

15:25.670 --> 15:27.010
I kept pushing forward.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.340
I fought to earn this.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.980
If I hadn't fought,

15:33.600 --> 15:34.460
perhaps,

15:36.440 --> 15:38.060
you would've forgotten me.

15:39.030 --> 15:40.700
There'd be no game today.

15:42.910 --> 15:43.700
I understand

15:45.390 --> 15:46.890
you have your calculations too.

15:48.360 --> 15:49.580
You're gambling as well.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.340
I'm done.

16:01.270 --> 16:02.100
You may head back now.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.420
I'm taking my leave.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.820
After all, you're my first child.

16:29.790 --> 16:31.060
When the dust settles,

16:33.630 --> 16:34.300
I will...

16:39.270 --> 16:40.850
grant you one chance to repent

16:42.120 --> 16:43.940
and spare you a way to live.

16:53.960 --> 16:54.610
It's a poison array.

16:55.440 --> 16:56.530
Same as the one

16:56.600 --> 16:57.340
outside the Clinic.

17:08.830 --> 17:10.730
Seems this generation of their Mus

17:11.880 --> 17:14.660
has youths worth admiring.

17:15.240 --> 17:15.860
Grand-uncle Mu,

17:16.270 --> 17:17.330
any way to break it?

17:19.680 --> 17:20.530
Leave it to me.

17:28.070 --> 17:28.730
Outside this array,

17:29.110 --> 17:30.700
there's also a formation master.

17:31.200 --> 17:31.860
Our poison array

17:31.860 --> 17:33.090
won't last a stick of incense.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.530
My skills will only slow you down.

17:34.960 --> 17:35.620
You may go first.

17:39.310 --> 17:39.860
How about

17:41.000 --> 17:41.940
we toss a coin?

17:42.550 --> 17:43.330
If the Peach Blossom side lands up,

17:43.880 --> 17:44.570
it means

17:45.110 --> 17:46.330
we'll leave here safely

17:47.160 --> 17:48.090
and beat Yumo

17:48.750 --> 17:50.420
to the first wedding at the Falling Stars Pavilion.

17:51.270 --> 17:52.180
If it lands on the Sword side,

17:54.270 --> 17:55.050
it means

17:56.400 --> 17:57.900
we'll die here together...

18:01.590 --> 18:02.220
and meet again

18:03.200 --> 18:04.090
in the next life.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.010
What wedding?

18:06.640 --> 18:08.050
Don't fool around at a time like this!

18:09.550 --> 18:10.050
Come on!

18:27.440 --> 18:28.180
What's that?

18:31.750 --> 18:32.530
It's called...

18:33.880 --> 18:35.010
turning ill luck to good.

18:49.160 --> 18:51.010
Looks like you're a sacrificed piece.

18:52.590 --> 18:53.290
A sacrifice?

18:54.920 --> 18:56.090
But I have someone at my side.

19:01.590 --> 19:02.700
Sacrifices stand alone.

19:04.400 --> 19:05.180
I don't.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.140
Not only that,

19:08.310 --> 19:09.900
I'll carve a bloody path...

19:13.400 --> 19:14.530
for the one I love beside me.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.380
Qingyang!

20:05.440 --> 20:05.940
Xuewei!

20:13.310 --> 20:14.180
It's Three Thousand Realms.

20:14.440 --> 20:15.860
With fire, this toxin turns to mist.

20:17.110 --> 20:18.090
Everyone, back three feet!

20:18.350 --> 20:19.220
Cover your nose and mouth!

20:22.440 --> 20:23.050
Qingyang!

20:37.790 --> 20:38.940
You're not allowed to die.

20:42.030 --> 20:43.140
If you die,

20:45.440 --> 20:46.420
I won't agree

20:47.510 --> 20:49.620
to your wedding at the Falling Stars Pavilion.

20:56.830 --> 20:57.530
If...

21:00.550 --> 21:01.420
I don't die...

21:05.270 --> 21:06.620
then you'll say yes?

21:07.980 --> 21:14.220
♪The slanting rain moistens a youthful chain♪

21:14.420 --> 21:18.220
♪In a fleeting glance, I gather frost and regret♪

21:18.660 --> 21:22.180
♪Upon the board, I wager my soul to chase the moon again♪

21:22.300 --> 21:28.780
♪Snow in my heart, untouched through all these years...♪

21:28.790 --> 21:29.600
Qingyang!

21:30.350 --> 21:31.160
Qingyang!

21:34.030 --> 21:34.730
Qingyang!

21:35.240 --> 21:35.980
Qingyang!

21:37.270 --> 21:38.330
Qingyang!

21:39.240 --> 21:40.090
Don't cry...

21:44.180 --> 21:47.940
♪Between gain and loss, I cling to what won't fade...♪

21:49.640 --> 21:50.180
Qingyang!

21:50.880 --> 21:51.620
Don't cry...

21:51.900 --> 21:58.780
♪Thank heaven this white world walks with the passing days...♪

22:01.790 --> 22:02.330
Qingyang...

22:04.310 --> 22:05.010
Qingyang...

22:07.750 --> 22:08.860
Qingyang...

22:13.000 --> 22:14.290
I just wanted to make you smile.

22:15.880 --> 22:17.330
Can't you talk right?

22:17.380 --> 22:19.010
Ow...

22:19.110 --> 22:20.220
Your poison!

22:24.720 --> 22:25.730
Those who can do more, right?

22:29.440 --> 22:30.180
I die!

22:33.400 --> 22:34.620
The third thing of mine

22:35.240 --> 22:36.220
is to tell Xuewei...

22:38.160 --> 22:38.980
I like her.

22:41.310 --> 22:42.010
And...

22:43.590 --> 22:44.620
I've liked her for years.

22:48.100 --> 22:51.580
♪In the end, all becomes but tales of the jianghu...♪

22:51.580 --> 22:56.700
[Frost descends at bleak dawn, a soft drizzle stirs the breeze]

22:56.700 --> 22:59.700
[Frost Descent today, the last of autumn]

22:59.700 --> 23:01.300
[Prince of Langya's Residence]

23:07.270 --> 23:08.290
Winter's coming.

23:09.640 --> 23:11.010
Last night, a blaze broke out

23:11.960 --> 23:13.180
in a south-side alley.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.620
Where's Lianyue?

23:16.830 --> 23:18.220
Tang Lianyue and the Spider Woman

23:18.790 --> 23:20.220
left Tianqi City last night.

23:21.160 --> 23:23.140
Seems those heirs

23:23.270 --> 23:24.900
who escaped Doom Abyss

23:25.480 --> 23:27.250
all slipped out to regroup outside.

23:27.830 --> 23:28.420
Of course,

23:29.270 --> 23:30.140
it could also be

23:30.510 --> 23:31.980
someone lured them away on purpose.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.840
So, Xueyue Sword Deity,

23:36.310 --> 23:38.050
will you help me?

23:43.000 --> 23:44.290
By my mother's wish,

23:44.880 --> 23:45.980
I only protect you.

23:46.510 --> 23:47.290
For anything else,

23:47.680 --> 23:48.860
she said not to heed you.

23:49.060 --> 23:53.860
[Under the Open Sky]

23:54.200 --> 23:56.140
Someone is spreading

23:56.160 --> 23:58.010
the puppet poison in Tianqi.

24:02.640 --> 24:03.640
You should know

24:03.750 --> 24:04.720
how terrible

24:04.790 --> 24:05.730
the drugged puppet art is.

24:06.640 --> 24:07.770
Of course I do.

24:08.920 --> 24:09.940
But that poison

24:10.480 --> 24:11.770
is deadly on the battlefield,

24:12.400 --> 24:13.660
not in Tianqi City.

24:14.550 --> 24:15.570
So, the poison

24:15.880 --> 24:17.220
is just a feint.

24:18.030 --> 24:19.140
They want to split our forces

24:19.550 --> 24:21.490
and draw our eyes.

24:23.790 --> 24:25.460
What truly matters now

24:26.070 --> 24:27.220
is the Dragonseal Scroll.

24:31.360 --> 24:32.420
Tell me,

24:32.870 --> 24:33.620
what if

24:34.030 --> 24:35.900
the Dragonseal Scroll appears

24:36.110 --> 24:37.940
with my name on it,

24:38.680 --> 24:39.700
and I refuse?

24:40.030 --> 24:40.730
What will happen?

24:43.270 --> 24:44.180
If the throne is unrightful,

24:44.790 --> 24:45.660
any with dragon's blood

24:46.000 --> 24:46.810
can claim it,

24:47.920 --> 24:48.980
and the realm falls to chaos.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.250
The Langya army in the south

24:54.070 --> 24:55.250
is already locked in fierce battle.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.380
And my father...

25:01.240 --> 25:02.490
is at death's door.

25:04.000 --> 25:05.140
Tianqi's main guardians

25:05.200 --> 25:06.290
have all been redeployed.

25:08.480 --> 25:10.460
Your health is this poor.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.810
And the Imperial Assembly is near,

25:13.350 --> 25:14.490
when all the generals and lords

25:14.550 --> 25:15.660
will converge on Tianqi.

25:16.880 --> 25:18.250
If someone steers it,

25:19.440 --> 25:20.730
if chaos comes,

25:22.030 --> 25:22.810
you won't hold it down.

25:25.960 --> 25:26.860
Xueyue Sword Deity,

25:27.680 --> 25:28.530
your first point

25:28.790 --> 25:29.900
was exactly right.

25:30.960 --> 25:32.220
Right now,

25:32.310 --> 25:33.420
the Dragonseal Scroll

25:33.550 --> 25:34.730
is the bigger problem

25:34.790 --> 25:35.900
to solve.

25:36.920 --> 25:37.530
But,

25:37.720 --> 25:38.900
I've searched for years

25:39.200 --> 25:40.330
and never found it.

25:40.880 --> 25:42.180
So I'll wait for the day

25:42.240 --> 25:43.490
they can't hold back.

25:44.350 --> 25:46.330
They'll make a play at the Imperial Assembly.

25:46.780 --> 25:48.370
I just need the chance

25:48.720 --> 25:50.620
to intercept it

25:50.830 --> 25:51.620
before it appears.

25:52.400 --> 25:52.940
That's all.

25:54.880 --> 25:55.620
So,

25:56.400 --> 25:57.330
one thing you said

25:57.640 --> 25:58.530
was off.

25:59.920 --> 26:00.730
Listen,

26:01.750 --> 26:02.700
here in Tianqi,

26:03.480 --> 26:06.010
no matter when chaos breaks,

26:06.590 --> 26:08.380
I, Xiao Ruofeng,

26:09.000 --> 26:11.010
can always hold it down.

26:22.400 --> 26:22.940
How's it going?

26:23.310 --> 26:24.220
Where is Master Mu?

26:24.750 --> 26:26.490
Ms. Wan'er's home is burned to the ground.

26:27.000 --> 26:27.940
The Jinwu Guard

26:28.030 --> 26:29.140
lines the whole lane.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.380
They claim

26:31.030 --> 26:31.770
all ones inside

26:32.000 --> 26:33.010
were slain.

26:35.880 --> 26:36.420
Then...

26:37.550 --> 26:39.380
Master Mu and Miss Xuewei...

26:40.440 --> 26:41.660
The guard is tight.

26:42.030 --> 26:43.940
We found no chance to slip in,

26:44.310 --> 26:45.530
so we saw no bodies.

26:46.350 --> 26:47.050
Maybe,

26:47.750 --> 26:48.900
it's planted news

26:49.030 --> 26:50.050
to mislead us.

26:50.480 --> 26:51.570
If they escaped,

26:52.070 --> 26:53.570
they should've reached us by now!

27:02.510 --> 27:03.180
A squad of soldiers

27:03.270 --> 27:04.290
have surrounded this area too.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.090
Are they Jinwu Guard too?

27:06.830 --> 27:07.250
No.

27:07.350 --> 27:08.010
Doesn't look like it.

27:16.680 --> 27:18.220
I'm Jia Feng, Commander of the Inner Security Division.

27:18.640 --> 27:19.980
By order of the Prince of Langya,

27:20.480 --> 27:21.380
I'm here to protect you.

27:25.160 --> 27:26.570
Under an investigation,

27:26.570 --> 27:27.110
[Kind Heart, Skilled Hands]

27:27.110 --> 27:28.500
I've completely sealed off

27:28.500 --> 27:29.250
three nearby alleys.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.460
Be it the Jinwu Guard and the Court of Judicial Review,

27:31.790 --> 27:33.570
none of their men can set foot here.

27:34.550 --> 27:35.420
If you're here to investigate,

27:35.960 --> 27:37.490
I'll ask your Prince of Langya

27:37.830 --> 27:38.530
for one person.

27:39.920 --> 27:40.700
Name him.

27:41.030 --> 27:42.140
The son of Li Xian, Deputy Commander

27:42.480 --> 27:43.250
of the Jinwu Guard.

27:45.030 --> 27:45.730
Understood.

27:47.550 --> 27:48.140
I'll take my leave.

28:02.200 --> 28:02.980
Su Muyu...

28:05.240 --> 28:05.940
Last night,

28:06.550 --> 28:08.180
Master Mu and Xuewei

28:11.160 --> 28:12.700
stayed behind in that courtyard.

28:22.510 --> 28:23.050
What's wrong?

28:23.790 --> 28:24.460
A spider bit me...

28:24.750 --> 28:25.220
What?

28:25.270 --> 28:26.010
- Spider? - Spider?

28:26.160 --> 28:27.180
- Spider... - Spider...

28:27.920 --> 28:29.330
It's a tracking Spider.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.460
Tracking Spider?

28:31.030 --> 28:32.620
- Tracking Spider! - Tracking Spider!

28:33.750 --> 28:34.420
Last time,

28:34.880 --> 28:35.730
someone was bitten at Doom Abyss.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.460
Was that you?

28:37.750 --> 28:38.090
Yes.

28:39.030 --> 28:40.620
I thought I was just unlucky.

28:42.550 --> 28:43.530
- Run! - Now!

28:44.270 --> 28:44.940
That way!

28:45.830 --> 28:46.940
- Move! - Go!

28:53.960 --> 28:54.940
Useless!

28:55.830 --> 28:56.940
Tell the guards outside.

28:57.440 --> 28:57.900
Run!

28:58.240 --> 28:58.700
Got it!

29:03.960 --> 29:04.570
Stay back!

29:04.960 --> 29:05.700
Stay back!

29:05.750 --> 29:06.220
Trying to run away?

29:09.240 --> 29:10.050
Too late.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.660
Spider Woman.

29:13.510 --> 29:14.090
It's me.

29:27.350 --> 29:28.940
Your signal arrow won't help now.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.290
Everyone in this manor

29:32.440 --> 29:33.700
has already been dealt with.

29:37.310 --> 29:39.570
As expected of the Xuanwu Guardian from Tang Clan

29:40.750 --> 29:41.980
and Blood River's Spider Woman,

29:43.110 --> 29:45.180
you kill without a sound.

29:46.070 --> 29:46.770
Come with me.

29:47.640 --> 29:48.730
Confess everything.

29:52.160 --> 29:52.620
Watch out!

30:07.440 --> 30:08.490
Haze swept clear,

30:10.000 --> 30:11.250
moon shines afar.

30:14.270 --> 30:14.940
Everyone,

30:16.240 --> 30:17.810
I'll go on ahead.

30:20.550 --> 30:21.050
Dead?

30:21.110 --> 30:21.660
What now?

30:28.310 --> 30:29.530
He was struck by snake venom.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.290
What do we do with the people here?

30:35.440 --> 30:36.380
Don't kill me!

30:38.790 --> 30:39.860
I'll send word for the Inner Security Division

30:39.920 --> 30:40.940
to seal this place off.

30:41.830 --> 30:43.140
Their identities are too sensitive.

30:45.830 --> 30:46.660
For now, we can't let them

30:46.720 --> 30:47.460
return to Tianqi.

30:51.540 --> 30:55.700
[Flying Tiger General's Residence]

30:58.310 --> 30:58.900
Your Highness.

31:01.310 --> 31:02.380
Fengxi Manor was attacked.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.860
The area was sealed

31:03.880 --> 31:04.620
by Tang Lianyue.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.810
Lord Haoyue was poisoned

31:07.070 --> 31:07.700
and is dead.

31:08.750 --> 31:09.420
Understood.

31:10.480 --> 31:11.860
Your Highness doesn't seem to care.

31:13.790 --> 31:15.090
Just a bunch of pieces.

31:16.070 --> 31:17.180
Since they're pieces,

31:17.920 --> 31:19.140
whose hand they fall into

31:19.550 --> 31:20.810
makes no difference.

31:23.440 --> 31:23.900
You may go.

31:25.510 --> 31:27.530
Let them hold that hot potato

31:28.240 --> 31:29.620
and really savor

31:30.240 --> 31:31.980
what panic feels like.

31:35.830 --> 31:36.290
Understood.

31:48.310 --> 31:49.900
The Imperial Assembly is almost here.

31:51.000 --> 31:51.900
Lords and generals

31:51.920 --> 31:52.900
are filing into the capital.

31:53.750 --> 31:55.180
Those who back us

31:55.680 --> 31:57.250
will gather in Tianqi.

31:59.030 --> 32:01.330
Plus that powerful item,

32:02.200 --> 32:03.660
this will become the best chance

32:04.240 --> 32:06.730
to wipe out all our enemies.

32:08.750 --> 32:10.330
The time to draw blades at last...

32:12.720 --> 32:14.250
is close now, Uncle.

32:15.310 --> 32:16.810
You visited the palace last night.

32:17.110 --> 32:18.050
Did he say anything?

32:21.880 --> 32:22.980
It no longer matters what he said,

32:23.030 --> 32:23.570
Uncle.

32:25.350 --> 32:27.460
Since he didn't detain me at court,

32:28.200 --> 32:30.330
it means he tacitly allows my moves.

32:32.070 --> 32:33.570
He might even be waiting

32:34.270 --> 32:35.730
for my duel with the Prince of Langya.

32:37.000 --> 32:38.700
An overlooked prince

32:40.440 --> 32:42.490
and a prince whose merit outshines the throne,

32:45.110 --> 32:45.900
either way,

32:46.640 --> 32:47.380
it's a deal

32:47.960 --> 32:50.050
that costs him nothing.

32:51.790 --> 32:53.010
My father

32:53.920 --> 32:55.050
was suspicious by nature,

32:56.070 --> 32:57.290
loving yet ruthless,

32:59.070 --> 33:00.770
born to rule.

33:02.160 --> 33:02.860
Yong...

33:07.480 --> 33:09.050
I will always remember

33:09.830 --> 33:11.690
the day my mother died,

33:13.720 --> 33:15.010
the freezing palace,

33:16.030 --> 33:17.290
the cold stares,

33:17.300 --> 33:18.290
and those

33:19.270 --> 33:20.900
fake sobs.

33:23.640 --> 33:25.220
From that day on,

33:26.550 --> 33:27.700
I began preparing

33:27.750 --> 33:28.900
for this day to come.

33:31.070 --> 33:32.290
I'll draw my sword to cut off

33:32.350 --> 33:33.420
all injustice.

33:35.550 --> 33:36.770
I'll take back

33:36.830 --> 33:38.220
all that should be mine!

33:39.000 --> 33:39.730
I will...

33:41.030 --> 33:42.530
stand alone at the pinnacle!

33:43.860 --> 33:45.700
[Still Waters]

33:54.310 --> 33:56.010
The Jinwu Guard wouldn't leave the lane.

33:56.310 --> 33:58.300
We staked out half a day for an opening.

33:58.550 --> 33:59.700
With the Inner Security Division's help,

33:59.960 --> 34:01.010
we slipped into the courtyard

34:01.880 --> 34:03.900
and took all the important items

34:04.240 --> 34:05.050
Master Mu had hidden in advance.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.170
Still no bodies found?

34:11.960 --> 34:12.460
No.

34:14.840 --> 34:15.650
Only this.

34:35.550 --> 34:36.860
Have the Inner Security Division men outside

34:37.510 --> 34:38.610
send word to the Prince of Langya.

34:40.800 --> 34:41.650
On cooperation,

34:41.670 --> 34:43.090
I'll assist him with all my strength.

34:44.590 --> 34:45.690
But aside from that,

34:48.030 --> 34:49.130
Blood River has debts in Tianqi

34:49.190 --> 34:50.050
to be paid in blood.

34:51.550 --> 34:52.490
We will not leave

34:52.590 --> 34:53.780
until they're settled.

34:56.510 --> 34:58.300
If this runs against his plan,

35:00.510 --> 35:01.900
tell him not to block us.

35:02.960 --> 35:03.570
Understood.

35:09.150 --> 35:09.780
What happened,

35:10.100 --> 35:10.850
Muyu?

35:11.590 --> 35:12.570
What exactly happened?

35:12.960 --> 35:14.610
I just passed by Ms. Wan'er's place

35:14.920 --> 35:16.460
and found the whole courtyard burned down.

35:17.190 --> 35:18.210
And on my way back,

35:18.590 --> 35:20.210
Men of the Inner Security Division were everywhere.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.340
Did...

35:24.920 --> 35:25.740
something happen?

35:27.480 --> 35:28.980
That base was exposed last night.

35:30.550 --> 35:31.740
We were attacked in the night.

35:33.030 --> 35:34.710
Uncle Zhe had just used the Divine-Demon Nirvana Art

35:34.710 --> 35:35.610
to finish healing me.

35:36.760 --> 35:37.940
We couldn't fight

35:38.800 --> 35:39.690
and had to withdraw.

35:41.070 --> 35:42.860
Qingyang and Xuewei stayed to cover us,

35:44.550 --> 35:45.530
and they didn't make it back.

35:50.150 --> 35:50.980
What do you mean...

35:53.840 --> 35:54.820
they didn't make it back?

36:12.230 --> 36:12.740
Yu,

36:13.960 --> 36:14.860
we used to treat

36:17.030 --> 36:18.050
a partner's death

36:19.070 --> 36:19.820
as something

36:19.880 --> 36:21.130
we took for granted.

36:23.880 --> 36:25.090
But now,

36:25.110 --> 36:26.130
everything is different.

36:30.070 --> 36:31.260
On the road to the Other Shore,

36:33.510 --> 36:34.490
how many partners

36:34.550 --> 36:35.650
will we lose?

36:46.480 --> 36:47.050
What about Changhe?

36:48.920 --> 36:49.530
Where is he?

36:55.070 --> 36:55.940
I've already sent Yin the Tiger

36:56.000 --> 36:56.900
to call him back.

36:58.550 --> 37:00.010
This isn't the time for seclusion.

37:01.920 --> 37:02.380
Yu,

37:03.070 --> 37:04.380
the Patriarch is no longer in the chamber.

37:06.960 --> 37:07.610
He's gone?

37:08.710 --> 37:09.460
That means

37:09.880 --> 37:11.210
he's completed training and left seclusion,

37:11.550 --> 37:12.860
yet didn't return to us at once.

37:15.550 --> 37:16.210
Where did he go?

37:18.800 --> 37:19.300
Su Muyu,

37:20.360 --> 37:21.610
has he ever acted on his own

37:22.630 --> 37:24.170
without telling you?

37:25.480 --> 37:26.210
In my memory,

37:27.360 --> 37:28.490
only once.

37:29.070 --> 37:29.610
When?

37:30.400 --> 37:32.090
When he tried to kill the former patriarch

37:34.030 --> 37:35.260
to seize the Dormant Dragon Sword.

37:38.400 --> 37:38.860
Maybe

37:39.480 --> 37:40.460
the Patriarch has other plans?

37:44.700 --> 37:48.180
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:48.220 --> 37:52.100
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:53.940 --> 37:57.420
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:57.460 --> 38:01.300
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

38:03.300 --> 38:06.580
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

38:06.700 --> 38:08.780
♪Still I can't let go♪

38:08.940 --> 38:12.380
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

38:12.860 --> 38:15.060
♪My heart no longer my own♪

38:15.180 --> 38:20.180
♪No one can escape from love♪

38:36.780 --> 38:40.500
♪How many hidden feelings♪

38:40.620 --> 38:44.700
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

38:45.940 --> 38:49.820
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

38:49.940 --> 38:54.180
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

38:55.300 --> 38:58.180
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

38:58.260 --> 39:02.500
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

39:04.780 --> 39:08.780
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

39:08.820 --> 39:12.260
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

39:13.780 --> 39:17.220
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

39:17.300 --> 39:21.100
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

39:23.020 --> 39:26.460
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

39:26.500 --> 39:30.340
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

39:32.380 --> 39:35.620
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

39:35.740 --> 39:37.820
♪Still I can't let go♪

39:38.020 --> 39:41.420
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

39:41.900 --> 39:44.100
♪My heart no longer my own♪

39:44.180 --> 39:49.220
♪No one can escape from love♪

